    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Encoder Role\n",
    "\n",
    "Input:\n",
    "\\[\n",
    "(x_1, \\dots, x_T)\n",
    "\\]\n",
    "\n",
    "Output:\n",
    "\\[\n",
    "(h_1, \\dots, h_T)\n",
    "\\]\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Each representation is **contextual**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Encoder Block\n",
    "\n",
    "Pipeline:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Multi-head attention  \n",
    "- Add & Norm  \n",
    "- Feedforward  \n",
    "- Add & Norm  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Feedforward Layer\n",
    "\n",
    "\\[\n",
    "\\text{FFN}(x)=\\max(0,xW_1+b_1)W_2+b_2\n",
    "\\]\n",
    "\n",
    "- Same network applied per token  \n",
    "- Learns nonlinear features  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Residual + Normalization\n",
    "\n",
    "\\[\n",
    "x + \\text{sublayer}(x)\n",
    "\\]\n",
    "\n",
    "- stabilizes training  \n",
    "- enables deep stacking  \n",
    "\n",
